eps:\r\n      -\r\n        name: Create Dockerfile\r\n        run: |\r\n          cat > ./Dockerfile <<EOL\r\n          FROM centos:8.3.2011\r\n          EOL\r\n      -\r\n        name: Set up Docker Buildx\r\n        uses: docker/setup-buildx-action@v2\r\n        with:\r\n          buildkitd-flags: --debug\r\n          config-inline: |\r\n            debug = true\r\n            [registry.\"docker.io\"]\r\n              mirrors = [\"dockerhub-remote.artifactory.company.int\"]\r\n      -\r\n        name: Build\r\n        uses: docker/build-push-action@v4\r\n        with:\r\n          context: .\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou should see occurrences of `dockerhub-remote.artifactory.company.int` in the BuildKit logs.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/comments/1514642186/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/comments/1514651407","html_url":"https://github.com/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/232#issuecomment-1514651407","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/docker/setup-buildx-action/issues/232","id":1514651407,"node_id":"IC_kwDOETHxjc5aR78P","user":{"login":"SebastianLeitz","id":85344655,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MzQ0NjU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85344655?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebastianLeitz","html_url":"https://github.com/SebastianLeitz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebastianLeitz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebastianLeitz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebastianLeitz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebastianLeitz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SebastianLeitz/subscriptions","organizations_u